#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Baseline Manifest Path"
msgstr "Indlela yeManifesti yeSiseko"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional path to a declarative YAML or XML baseline manifest used by drift checks, Doctor checks, and MCP status abilities."
msgstr "Indlela yokuzithandela eya kwimanifesti yesiseko ye-YAML okanye ye-XML esetyenziswa luhlolo lophambuko, uhlolo lwe-Doctor, kunye nezakhono zemo ye-MCP."

